      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of coronary artery aneurysm in the anterior descending artery of a young female is reported. It was complicated by myocardial infarction and ventricular aneurysm. The aetiology was probably bacterial. Surgical removal was undertaken because the ventricular aneurysm was so poorly tolerated."},
